# Spec-driven workflow

You MUST follow the **core** spec workflow for all coding tasks: Schema Gate, Spec Drift Gate, workflow steps 1–9, removal/rename protocol, and final output format. See **spec-workflow-core.mdc** for the full rules.

When working in this repository (Vinekeepers), also apply **spec-workflow-vinekeepers.mdc** for project-specific defaults (Java 21, Maven, JUnit 5, PowerShell). When the spec index defines a **validation** block, use those commands and shell for tests and static analysis.
